 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "plans lists three [name, monthlyPriceCents] pairs with distinct names. events lists [date \"YYYY-MM-DD\", eventType, planName] in strictly increasing date order within one year: START (when no plan is active) and SWITCH (to a different plan, when one is active) name a plan, END (when active) has null. A change takes effect on its own day: START and SWITCH days are billed at the new plan, the END day is not billed. After the last event the state lasts until December 31. A day with plan p in a month of N days costs price(p) / N. Return one row [ \"YYYY-MM\", cents ] per month with at least one billed day, in month order, where cents is the exact month total rounded half up to an integer.",
  "provenance": [
